<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Treasury to announce April budget data.</title>
<headline>Brazil Treasury to announce April budget data.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's National Treasury was due to announce budget data for the month of April at 1430 local/1730 GMT, a Finance Ministry spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>(( -- Brasilia newsroom 5561 2230358))</p>
